rd: row.at = row.at || ctx.clock.nowIso() ✓; appendUsage(..., ctx) ✓; bad --json ✓; requires model ✓; summary ✓.\n\n§5.2 `_util.mjs` provides arg/flag/usageFile ✓. \"命令模块之间不互相导入\" ✓.\n\n§5.3 bin ✓.\n\n§6 index.js: Let me check \"每条错误向 deps.ctx.stderr 写一行 `[cliworker] route registration failed: <path>: <message>\\n`（path 为 null 时写 (inject)）\". Implementation: `ctx.stderr.write(`[cliworker] route registration failed: ${where === null ? '(inject)' : where}: ${message}\\n`)` ✓.\n\n\"`createPlugin` 调用 `hostCtx.inject(['webServer'], (httpCtx) => …)`\" ✓. \"依次注册 /cliworker/providers、/cliworker/models、/cliworker/select、/cliworker/forecast\" ✓ order. \"每条用 `httpCtx.effect(() => httpCtx.webServer.register({ kind: 'exact', path, handler }), name)`\" ✓.\n\n\"hostCtx.inject 本身抛错，或不是函数：errors 放一条 { path: null, message }\" ✓.\n\n\"返回的 registered 与 errors 是实时对象\" ✓ (same arrays).\n\ngetRegistration ✓. apply ✓ error message prefix \"cliworker: route registration failed\" ✓ and lists each path: message ✓ (joined with '; '), error.registration = getRegistration() ✓.\n\n\"四个 handler 沿用现有实现（含 readBody、send），只替换注入点：配置用 loadConfig({ file, ctx })，状态用 providerStatus(c, { ctx })，forecast 额外传 now: ctx.now()\" ✓.\n\n\"settings 取 readonly（缺省 false）\" — not implemented. Old code didn't use it. Is there a test? Let me grep tests for readonly settings. Probably not. Should I add? Design lists it as a setting taken from settings. To be faithful I might do `const opts = { readonly: false, strict: false, ...s }` and use opts.readonly? But nothing uses readonly. Adding an unused local is dead code. I'll leave as is — actually hmm, \"规格以 design.md 为准，不要自行发明\". The design explicitly enumerates settings keys. A reviewer could check `createPlugin(host, {strict:true})` only. I think it's fine; but adding a normalized `readonly` default costs 1 line and satisfies literal reading. Let me look at impl.md §1/§2 to see what's claimed already.\n\nLet me read impl.md sections 1-3 and 11 (latest round) to align.","signature":""}],"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b739d9707e819deeb987e6ae745b","_messageId":"01a1b73bc202751a9c9aa6e830c24dac","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b739d9707e819deeb987e6ae745b","codebuddy.ai/modelRequestId":"01a1b73bc202751a9c9aa6e830c24dac","codebuddy.ai/llmMessageId":"01a1b73bc202751a9c9aa6e830c24dac","codebuddy.ai/messageId":"01a1b73b-c202-751a-9c9a-a6ea7847427d","traceparent":"00-74b9dfff07cab8a4abe921b11db84963-aa0f475921555b00-01","baggage":"codebuddy.session_id=01a1b739-d4c0-7bc3-b609-96aa963898cd,codebuddy.conversation_request_id=01a1b739d9707e819deeb987e6ae745b"},"__timestamp":"2026-11-07T18:18:37.286Z"}
